m/apps/1481260/extras/64050ac667f44c6f3bb70a0cd5a57eb2.poster.avif?t=1787187332\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481260/extras/64050ac667f44c6f3bb70a0cd5a57eb2.webm?t=1787187332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481260/extras/64050ac667f44c6f3bb70a0cd5a57eb2.mp4?t=1787187332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Content Placement (PCP)</strong><br>The maps aren't the exact same every run, but they're not totally random either. It's built from real designed layouts so it still feels like a place, just enough changes each time to keep you on edge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481260/extras/af78135516171c4f929d22a9d23ff0b7.poster.avif?t=1787187332\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481260/extras/af78135516171c4f929d22a9d23ff0b7.webm?t=1787187332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481260/extras/af78135516171c4f929d22a9d23ff0b7.mp4?t=1787187332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifact Hunting</strong><br>You can pick up and move basically anything. Shove stuff around, mess with objects, most of the time you will be looking for artifacts anyways. - <i>they can help you in the long run ....</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481260/extras/11b94f6ca5aa663043f7fa39c02e244f.poster.avif?t=1787187332\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481260/extras/11b94f6ca5aa663043f7fa39c02e244f.webm?t=1787187332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481260/extras/11b94f6ca5aa663043f7fa39c02e244f.mp4?t=1787187332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity Chat</strong><br>Talking to your friends only works if you're actually close to them. So yeah, get separated and good luck, you're on your own until you find each other again ... unless you have a walkie then maybe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481260/extras/c1c003452bb89697e188e661a77e9f43.poster.avif?t=1787187332\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481260/extras/c1c003452bb89697e188e661a77e9f43.webm?t=1787187332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481260/extras/c1c003452bb89697e188e661a77e9f43.mp4?t=1787187332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Garage Lobby Customization</strong><br>This is basically our hangout between runs. Deck it out with whatever you've earned, set up your loadout, hang your trophies on the wall, whatever. It's your crew's space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now that basically covers it all, I think you will do just fine ... right?</p>", "short_description": "Ev